    "body": "patch ready, held until the v0.11.0 release gate frees main. From TNC 640 ISO manual 892909-25: N-numbered blocks with * (p.130), signed words + two-digit G (pp.66,131,752), %NAME G71 begin/end (pp.130,143,755), ; comments (p.172); drilling expands into G00/G01 chains + FUNCTION DWELL (G81-G89 don't exist; G73 = ROTATION, G80 = WORKING PLANE, p.752/756); G54/G55 aren't work-offset selects (p.754/756) - first offset posts no word, others refused; T.. G17 S.. + M3 (no M6); G53 homing removed. Tapping refused by name. Follow-ups: #51 (native cycles + G247), #52 (.I extension).",
